<title>PERU: Peru sees 1996 GDP growth 2.5 pct vs 7.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Peru sees 1996 GDP growth 2.5 pct vs 7.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's Economy Minister Jorge Camet told Congress Wednesday the government estimated the economy would grow around 2.5 percent this year, down from 7.0 percent last year.</p>
<p>&quot;We hope in December to close the year with a growth rate of 2.5 percent,&quot; Camet said.</p>
</text>
